{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And it came to pass at the end of days</b>. Since Cain worked the soil, he brought the meal offering to the place he had designated for his prayer. And the words of those who say that the meal offering was brought to his father are not right in my eyes; and because it is written \"from the firstborn of his flock,\" there is support that Cain did not bring from the firstborn."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:43:06.640217839Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}